    173  f025							; as rects + 2 + 2*nrect from the rect list it already copies (C3).
    174  f025
    175  f025							; --- A3 (2026-10-19): the rect stream, the PF block and the room meta
    176  f025							;     live in BANK3 (the level-data bank). One tail-jump into the block
    177  f025							;     reader; it returns to ERBlocksDone with the ptrs still in ZP.
    178  f025							;     0 pushes (the room-load chain sits at the measured SP floor).
    179  f025		       4c 50 f4 	      jmp	ERBlocksPad
    180  f028				   ERBlocksDone
