   1466  fb7f							; ==============================================================================
   1467  fb7f							; PhVcApplyOR / PhVcApplyAND DELETED (2026-10-19) — same retired vcrunch
   1468  fb7f							; tramp path. PhHcrEntry now stores the prefix mask directly (fixed 10).
   1469  fb7f							; ==============================================================================
   1470  fb7f							; ==============================================================================
   1471  fb7f							; HcrClock — hcrunch animation clock (fixed full=10 since 2026-10-19).
   1472  fb7f							;   In:  X = full extent (cells, ≥1); reads EnemyRamP (StartFrame-pinned)
   1473  fb7f							;   Out: A = covered (1..full) — never 0 (always-solid stub)
   1474  fb7f							;   Clobbers A (X/Y preserved — unlike CrunchClock). No latch: the kill
   1475  fb7f							;   repeats on contact (DropArm respawns at the room top, so no loop).
   1476  fb7f							; s = EnemyRamP>>4 (0..15, one 256f period = 16 buckets of 16f):
   1477  fb7f							;   s 0-3   dwell at home  (eff 0)	  -> n=1, 64f stub
   1478  fb7f							;   s 4-12  grow to center  (eff s-3)	  -> n 2..full (1..9 cells of
   1479  fb7f							;	    8px — full=w>>1; w=20 record = center of the screen)
   1480  fb7f							;   s 13-15 fast retract    (eff 3*(15-s) = 6,3,0) — wipe home in 3
   1481  fb7f							;	    steps (the old instant far-end turn, stretched to center)
   1482  fb7f							; covered = 1 + min(eff, full-1). CrunchClock (sc>>2 triangle, ~4f/step)
   1483  fb7f							; stays for its VCR mirrors + verify_build token gate — only the two
   1484  fb7f							; hcrunch call sites moved here (16f/step, grow-to-center ruling
   1485  fb7f							; 2026-10-16). Both callers pass full=10 (PhHcrEntry stages it, HOV
   1486  fb7f							; tests it); the latch freeze was removed with the 2026-10-19 contract.
   1487  fb7f							; ==============================================================================
   1488  fb7f				   HcrClock
   1489  fb7f		       e0 01		      cpx	#1
   1490  fb81		       d0 03		      bne	.hcN
   1491  fb83		       a9 01		      lda	#1	; full=1: n always 1
   1492  fb85		       60		      rts
